],"#FVEstimator: A novel food volume estimator Wellness model for calorie measurement and healthy living#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[39,40],"#FVEstimator: A novel food volume estimator Wellness model for calorie measurement and healthy living#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/FLWY2RH3","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/DEH77L6B?page=1&annotation=SQERZ8MS","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/DEH77L6B?page=1&annotation=BJ7KC4Y2","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 11","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/DEH77L6B?page=11&annotation=TQKVM425","line":39}],"metadata":{"Title":"FVEstimator: A novel food volume estimator Wellness model for calorie measurement and healthy living","Authors":"Prachi Kadam, Sharnil Pandya, Shraddha Phansalkar, Mayur Sarangdhar, Nayana Petkar, Ketan Kotecha, Deepak Garg","Year":2022,"DOI":"10.1016/j.measurement.2022.111294","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"background. In this work, mask-based RCNN is employed that helps accurate segmentation of food images with regular and irregular shapes in multi-food dish scenarios. The RCNN based food segmentation is applied as a volume estimator model. It is developed by fine-tuning the pre-trained ResNet model and trained over a dataset of 8 different classes of Indian breakfast food images in all shape","Findings":"The estimator model yields a precision of 90.9% for convex-shaped food images, 90.46% for amorphous food images in regular serving containers, and 98.5% to 98.9% for regular shaped (square and circle) food items.","Conclusions":"The work opens the research opportunities in images-based automated food volume estimation using deep learning methods. This will help enhance automatic image-based dietary monitoring systems, which will help the patients, athletes, weight-watchers, etc., to record their diet and maintain a healthy lifestyle by tracking the calorie count by correctly identifying and estimating the portion size of the food they are eating.","Limitations":"","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"o8yp6x","at":1774939547054}},"smart_blocks:Augmented Dietitian Okunmuşlar/kadamFVEstimatorNovelFood2022a.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.0206726,-0.02300568,0.02489921,0.02736896,-0.00274805,0.01930021,-0.01105176,0.01491037,0.00858247,-0.00847872,-0.00322279,-0.13718638,0.0114208,0.06928213,0.06255482,-0.03381954,0.04583712,0.04041733,0.0248694,-0.02563106,0.10722311,-0.04176522,0.05544296,-0.048858,0.04267149,0.04818105,0.000034,-0.04924028,-0.0603875,-0.24108921,0.05571056,-0.01645376,0.07543766,-0.05127105,-0.06262669,0.00347529,-0.0196872,0.01965839,-0.04986467,0.02477017,0.02052043,0.02650822,0.00465696,-0.00770887,-0.03055602,-0.01541933,-0.07829577,-0.01324183,-0.03721191,-0.03272185,-0.00056528,-0.03620637,0.05275111,0.00949777,0.01803008,0.02730972,0.02962191,0.02471687,0.08572248,0.0933222,0.04311589,0.06234652,-0.19586317,0.06212984,-0.0011811,0.00363313,-0.04006781,0.01160366,-0.0017989,-0.01372722,-0.00979179,0.02857328,0.01720958,-0.02153963,0.02171974,-0.06021393,0.04740047,-0.03653908,-0.02852021,-0.00298825,0.00376742,0.10259572,0.00347211,-0.03129541,-0.02927779,-0.02892991,0.01911319,-0.10067912,0.0375047,-0.0526263,-0.01272463,-0.02011411,-0.00311163,-0.01681449,-0.00525721,-0.02581122,-0.00157733,0.00598848,-0.04498322,0.10864051,-0.0242882,-0.03663548,0.03644209,0.01346915,0.0278788,-0.06357589,-0.0516263,-0.01261754,-0.00109227,0.06285544,-0.02537837,0.05628308,-0.0138976,0.00686335,0.0098903,0.01814619,0.10421582,0.02262372,0.04471951,0.00019264,-0.04297155,0.02671907,0.03400793,0.00134225,-0.0023695,0.00010006,-0.00073346,0.05419707,0.02065936,0.04023217,0.07326351,-0.0052569,-0.1042